に影響が出そうなんで寝ますー","ts":"1625592595.378100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Mbhk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"28c16561-92d8-4743-9926-d4f51d5bf086","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"yak shave","ts":"1625592506.377800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7Alm8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b4f95515-2a10-4e99-828e-7db16ade084f","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"今日はLispを書こうと思っていたのに。。気づいたらsicpの日本語訳を頑張ってmakeし。。と思ったらsicpとLispのパーサ作る話は全く関係なくて、、ちょっとRust使ってみるかとか思ってしまって。。なぜか今Emacsの設定してるのなぜ。。","ts":"1625592481.377700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"aruaru","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U012MBD7MFZ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G=1fU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4adff659-eac3-46e8-a334-474d7a90d565","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Vimは式ベースマクロとは縁遠いのでこのへんは羨ましさありますね","ts":"1625592390.377500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9FI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"99c0836f-0ad8-41c0-8116-aae89d5c0a05","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"指定されたS式を元に関数を生成してその関数をadd-hookするの、うぉー! マクロ使ってるー!って感じで良さがある。","ts":"1625592305.377300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i=cn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f9a29353-cae1-4fc1-8c38-b9df406a9c1b","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":":mode-hookは便利すぎるのでみんな使って欲しい","ts":"1625592232.377000","edited":{"user":"UDPT2BZ6E","ts":"1625592947.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0nJU2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"615a1bff-a444-44f5-9631-4f4f0c97667d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"マクロりょく","ts":"1625592198.376700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mxQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57a5b07c-e4a7-4421-87f2-126185dde673","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ぺた。\n\n\u0026gt; org-mode-hookにそういう関数を登録すればいいです。\n\u0026gt; leafではこうです。\n```(leaf org\n  :mode-hook\n  (setq-local evil-auto-indent nil))```\n\u0026gt; 展開したらこうなります。\n```(progn\n  (defun leaf-keywords-mode-hook--org--org-mode-hook nil\n    \"Function autogenerated by leaf-keywords in leaf-block `org' for hook `org-mode-hook'.\"\n    (setq-local evil-auto-indent nil))\n  (add-hook 'org-mode-hook 'leaf-keywords-mode-hook--org--org-mode-hook))```\n\u0026gt; use-packageには:mode-hookキーワードはありません (宣伝)\n","ts":"1625592106.376600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gmnsP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"481e6f2f-c78c-446d-9c7d-c48163230494","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"あ、こっちでも投稿されてたんですね。(Emacs-jpは全投稿で通知されるので) 向こうで書いてしまいました。","ts":"1625592041.376400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bOObL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6389d2aa-8695-4b88-a319-6a03db604b77","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"setqするだけの関数作ってadd-hookでorg-mode-hookに叩き込んだら上手くいかないかしら","ts":"1625591725.376200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UW4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"244d6f32-cb82-40ff-a8d9-f0dcbaf3c28c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"(合ってるか分からないけど)hook使ったらいいんですかね \u003chttps://ayatakesi.github.io/emacs/24.5/Hooks.html|https://ayatakesi.github.io/emacs/24.5/Hooks.html\u003e","ts":"1625591688.376000","attachments":[{"fallback":"GNU Emacs Manual(Japanese Translation): Hooks","id":1,"title":"GNU Emacs Manual(Japanese Translation): Hooks","title_link":"https://ayatakesi.github.io/emacs/24.5/Hooks.html","text":"GNU Emacs Manual(Japanese Translation): Hooks","blocks":null,"service_name":"ayatakesi.github.io","from_url":"https://ayatakesi.github.io/emacs/24.5/Hooks.html","original_url":"https://ayatakesi.github.io/emacs/24.5/Hooks.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2YDxw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2b8f7162-b97c-4845-88dc-a5737678ed34","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"org-modeのときにevil-auto-indentをnilにするの書き方が分かんないです\n下記の書き方をするとバッファローカルになってinit.elを開いてるバッファで有効化しちゃいました\n```(use-package org\n  :config\n  (setq evil-auto-indent nil))```","ts":"1625591236.375700","thread_ts":"1625591236.375700","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N/h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"950d5f75-f192-452f-9222-ebb1442484a7","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"そういえばevilつかってるのでoしたときにまたインデント挿入されてるんでした\nこいつも修正しないと...","ts":"1625589474.374200","edited":{"user":"U01U44T1FK2","ts":"1625589487.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xZ2o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"AC884AAE-848D-47D2-A161-F6A0D55AF507","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"より正確な手順としては、describe-key を使って実行したキーバインドが、どのモードのコマンドを実行したのかを調べて、そのモードマップにキーバインドを設定すると確実です。","ts":"1625589149.373400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YK1h="}]},{"client_msg_id":"912C9185-834B-4CB5-92AD-7817B736A1BA","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"基本はそんな感じで、好きなコマンドを割り当てるだけです。\n他には自分でコマンドを書いて割り当てる、既存のコマンドを改良する、などの選択肢があります。","ts":"1625588837.370200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"ari","count":1,"users":["U01U44T1FK2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uG6"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"期待通り動くことは観測できました","ts":"1625